le_name": "BlindSimulator_Bus.png", "id": "1003437577895913", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391969_1003437581229246_653195394531631588_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oFlv8-IcX0sQ7kNvwFmftWY&_nc_oc=Ado3JunEjI7oTiitp9C05My7XalNRiQ1GTn4vKYQ-O2JaFZXn6jNVPyjqVS79nW-cKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFN-KGg4zSEAWUykdU3tQweeafPggWR6uI_YDfIRQLrPA&oe=6A90247E"}, {"file_name": "BlindSimulator_Stair.png", "id": "4044188659173246", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391885_4044188662506579_7546195151401081343_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0znAaZ_c_sUQ7kNvwFv7FOF&_nc_oc=AdqYXp9D3nEjdvvpjwQWNrwQTj_uV8Yqpr41FDH0eD4xLIaShf43pKvSPw8inVwh-Sg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHFxxDX0xH3LxmiMyu5aDnEm6YOQMQZVZlylqhWF1b2Sw&oe=6A901CDA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "1367209481281777", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473396584_1367209484615110_5666152302652103209_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=osnNOHGdKZkQ7kNvwHHTKVF&_nc_oc=AdrWKSoBO1pz_kKWuogCgJbfqQAqFfwxsff02Xc4HA8Yxj_hr2SxSHD2An81WsKRTjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE5u6jWm__Ey12UxduT2NUbtVt-KsAxKz-5hQ5l4e78bw&oe=6A903C46"}, "display_name": "BlindSimulator", "keywords": ["Blind", "Simulator", "Education", "Cane", "Experience"], "long_description": "**'Blind Simulator'** is a VR simulation game that offers a unique perspective by allowing players to experience the world as a blind person.\n\nPlayers begin the game without sight and must rely on a white cane as their only tool to explore their surroundings.\nTapping the cane on the ground creates a sonar effect, which temporarily reveals the shapes and objects in the nearby space.\n\n\n{1483889342761078}\n\n\nOn the journey to a hospital, players use public transportation such as buses and subways, and navigate crowded streets and unfamiliar environments \u2014 all within a fully virtual, safe-to-experience setting.\nThrough this process'**how to sense and understand the world without directly seeing it**'.\n\n\n{2251899381954384}\n\n\nThis game goes beyond a simple simulation \u2014 it conveys the everyday discomforts and fears faced by people with visual impairments.\nIt is designed with an educational purpose and presents a narrative-driven VR experience that resonates with players.\n\n\n{1438988117330894}\n\n\n**Start a new kind of exploration where you learn to \"see without seeing\" \u2014 using sound, vibration, and spatial awareness as your only guides.**\n\n\n{1846104142685848}", "short_description": "Experience the journey of a blind person navigating the world using only sound and touch in immersive VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero_Cover_BS.png", "id": "2518919831796602", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293144_2518919835129935_1413575938524185386_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1gYGiEmAiIoQ7kNvwEAkBzL&_nc_oc=AdrRzuQtujGwl_FGwdnjUiIYvlZnnEVHgCQIG8RV33EbyO9CBFKMuP_VZjSrwktuuAk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEry_t_IdDAspvYu9Jh241R3ScUWLpQ31lT7_cLo_5sgw&oe=6A903F61"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Sight_BS.png", "id": "1889382115345316", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623599_1889382118678649_1627841262428749483_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0gwhtTwJs0IQ7kNvwGWapDq&_nc_oc=AdoOOCc6X2yYmXIpSy0O8mhgd_EdYn6nHAzkOockxFWHX5ol-VhbeTGk3durmuitbPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGOKZYppJ0f6N2BmeTfpPtUdK9dLYnZds265N0q-WTnCQ&oe=6A903EB1"}, {"file_name": "Logo_BS.png", "id": "1282969720083144", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/4